OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhy is there a shortage of 'wizard'
OL,4,Aelevator mechanics?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They wait and they wait," says
OL,7,FLembesis, a field technician for
OL,8,FParkway Elevators. "There's a lot of
OL,9,Ffrustration. Sometimes it's a repeat
OL,10,Fissue. It's a never-ending cycle, you
OL,11,Fknow what I mean?"
OL,13,FThe widely reported shortage of lift
OL,14,Fand escalator mechanics in the US,
OL,15,Fwhich is also a problem in many other
OL,16,Fcountries, has got worse over time, he
OL,17,Fadds: "It's been like night and day
OL,18,Fcompared to when I started."
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
